dumb it down to your level.

1519
01:18:33.840 --> 01:18:35.807
Sorry I don't speak moron
as well as you,

1520
01:18:35.920 --> 01:18:37.887
but let me try. Duh!

1521
01:18:47.680 --> 01:18:48.966
Oh, thank goodness you're back!

1522
01:18:49.079 --> 01:18:50.969
- Things are really messed up!
- We found this idea.

1523
01:18:51.119 --> 01:18:53.087
We were just trying to
make happy memories.

1524
01:19:02.880 --> 01:19:04.324
Joy, you got to fix this! Get up there!

1525
01:19:04.439 --> 01:19:06.100
Sadness, it's up to you.

1526
01:19:06.199 --> 01:19:08.088
- Me?
- Sadness?

1527
01:19:08.520 --> 01:19:09.680
I can't, Joy.

1528
01:19:09.800 --> 01:19:12.405
Yes, you can. Riley needs you.

1529
01:19:24.479 --> 01:19:25.605
Okay.

1530
01:19:46.159 --> 01:19:48.765
Wait! Stop! I want to get off!

1531
01:20:00.520 --> 01:20:02.180
All right. Thank you. We will.

1532
01:20:02.279 --> 01:20:04.567
Her teacher hasn't even
seen Riley all day.

1533
01:20:04.680 --> 01:20:05.779
- What?
- What was she wearing last?

1534
01:20:05.880 --> 01:20:08.000
- Do you even remember what...
- I can't believe this.

1535
01:20:08.079 --> 01:20:09.240
Riley, there you are!
Thank goodness!

1536
01:20:09.359 --> 01:20:10.460
We were worried sick!

1537
01:20:10.560 --> 01:20:11.979
Where have you been? It's so late!

1538
01:20:12.079 --> 01:20:14.127
Oh, honey!
What happened? Are you all right?

1539
01:20:14.239 --> 01:20:16.162
We asked the neighbors,
I called the school,

1540
01:20:16.319 --> 01:20:17.650
we talked to your teacher.

1541
01:21:44.319 --> 01:21:47.563
I know you don't want me to but...

1542
01:21:48.760 --> 01:21:50.091
I miss home.

1543
01:21:52.079 --> 01:21:53.649
I miss Minnesota.

1544
01:21:57.079 --> 01:22:00.208
You need me to be happy, but...

1545
01:22:02.119 --> 01:22:06.569
I want my old friends,
and my hockey team.

1546
01:22:09.000 --> 01:22:10.489
I want to go home.

1547
01:22:12.479 --> 01:22:13.970
Please don't be mad.

1548
01:22:17.039 --> 01:22:18.500
Oh, sweetie.

1549
01:22:18.600 --> 01:22:19.886
We're not mad.

1550
01:22:21.640 --> 01:22:25.087
You know what? I miss Minnesota too.

1551
01:22:26.920 --> 01:22:29.525
I miss the woods where we took hikes.

1552
01:22:30.239 --> 01:22:32.685
And the backyard where you used to play.

1553
01:22:33.439 --> 01:22:36.409
Spring Lake, where you learned to skate.

1554
01:22:38.520 --> 01:22:39.680
Come here.

1555
01:24:01.159 --> 01:24:02.810
Hey, I'm liking this new view.

1556
01:24:02.920 --> 01:24:04.331
Friendship Island has expanded.

1557
01:24:04.439 --> 01:24:06.920
Glad they finally opened
that Friendly Argument section.

1558
01:24:07.079 --> 01:24:09.180
I like Tragic Vampire Romance Island.

1559
01:24:09.279 --> 01:24:11.899
Fashion Island?
Oh. Everyone shut up.

1560
01:24:12.000 --> 01:24:14.162
Boy Band Island?
Hope that's just a phase.

1561
01:24:14.279 --> 01:24:17.170
Say what you want,
I think it's all beautiful.

1562
01:24:18.399 --> 01:24:19.619
All right. Here you go.

1563
01:24:19.720 --> 01:24:22.529
Your new expanded console
is up and runnin'.

1564
01:24:22.640 --> 01:24:24.005
- Ooh!
- Wow!

1565
01:24:24.159 --> 01:24:25.490
- Cool! Upgrade!
- Ooh!

1566
01:24:25.600 --> 01:24:26.680
Hey! Whoa-ho!

1567
01:24:26.800 --> 01:24:28.119
Whoops, wait. Did I just do that?

1568
01:24:29.359 --> 01:24:30.500
Hey, guys? What's pub-er-ty?

1569
01:24:30.600 --> 01:24:32.579
I don't know.
It's probably not important.

1570
01:24:32.680 --> 01:24:36.650
Whoa. I have access to
the entire curse word library!

1571
01:24:36.800 --> 01:24:38.300
This new console is the...

1572
01:24:40.159 --> 01:24:41.524
Sorry. I did it again. My bad.

1573
01:24:41.680 --> 01:24:42.800
They're getting to the rink.

1574
01:24:44.760 --> 01:24:46.260
Now when you get out there,
you be aggressive!

1575
01:24:46.359 --> 01:24:48.119
- I know, Dad.
- But not too aggressive.

1576
01:24:48.199 --> 01:24:50.725
You know, you guys don't
have to come to every game.

1577
01:24:50.920 --> 01:24:52.779
Are you kidding? I'm not missing one!

1578
01:24:52.880 --> 01:24:53.881
Go Foghorns!

1579
01:24:54.000 --> 01:24:55.899
Go Riley! Foghorns are the best!

1580
01:24:56.000 --> 01:24:57.809
Okay! I got to go!

1581
01:24:58.560 --> 01:24:59.779
- Aw!
- They love us.

1582
01:24:59.880 --> 01:25:01.500
Yeah, Mom and Dad are pretty cool.

1583
01:25:01.600 --> 01:25:04.046
Guys, of course they are.
But we can't show it.

1584
01:25:06.359 --> 01:25:07.725
She loved the face painting!

1585
01:25:07.840 --> 01:25:09.364
Ha! Told you it was a great idea!

1586
01:25:10.399 --> 01:25:12.083
Best idea he's had in a while.

1587
01:25:12.199 --> 01:25:13.659
He's a really good guy.

1588
01:25:18.359 --> 01:25:19.520
Just in case.

1589
01:25:20.840 --> 01:25:21.841
Oh!

1590
01:25:23.439 --> 01:25:24.440
Sorry.

1591
01:25:28.720 --> 01:25:31.006
Girl! Girl! Girl!

1592
01:25:32.560 --> 01:25:35.404
Uh... Okay. Bye.

1593
01:25:37.279 --> 01:25:40.011
Remember, just hustle.

1594
01:25:40.119 --> 01:25:41.451
Go, Riley!

1595
01:25:42.239 --> 01:25:43.479
You got this!

1596
01:25:45.399 --> 01:25:47.140
- You ready?
- Yeah.

1597
01:25:47.239 --> 01:25:49.606
All right. Let's play some hockey!

1598
01:25:49.720 --> 01:25:51.800
All right, Anger, take it!

1599
01:25:51.880 --> 01:25:53.060
Give us that puck
or you're dead meat!

1600
01:25:53.159 --> 01:25:54.140
On our left. On our left!

1601
01:25:54.239 --> 01:25:55.765
Let's just try not
to get all smelly this time.

1602
01:25:55.920 --> 01:25:58.287
Oh. Mom and Dad
are watching us fail.

1603
01:25:58.399 --> 01:25:59.480
Not for long!

1604
01:26:01.079 --> 01:26:03.199
We've been through
a lot lately, that's for sure.

1605
01:26:03.239 --> 01:26:04.969
But we still love our girl.

1606
01:26:05.079 --> 01:26:07.859
She has great new friends,
a great new house.

1607
01:26:07.960 --> 01:26:09.246
Things couldn't be better.

1608
01:26:09.600 --> 01:26:13.399
After all, Riley's twelve now.
What could happen?

1609
01:26:34.319 --> 01:26:37.563
And who can tell me what year
San Francisco was founded?

1610
01:26:37.680 --> 01:26:39.603
Anyone? Jordan?

1611
01:26:39.880 --> 01:26:41.609
Uh...

1612
01:26:42.000 --> 01:26:43.539
How much more of this?

1613
01:26:43.640 --> 01:26:45.699
Five months, two weeks and four days

1614
01:26:45.800 --> 01:26:47.324
until summer vacation.

1615
01:26:47.439 --> 01:26:50.523
Then it's off to the Bahamas
with you know who!

1616
01:26:51.199 --> 01:26:53.770
Come fly with me, gatinha.

1617
01:26:57.800 --> 01:26:59.289
Have a nice day.

1618
01:27:00.279 --> 01:27:01.440
What are we mad about?

1619
01:27:01.640 --> 01:27:03.529
I don't know.
Whatever Troy's mad about.

1620
01:27:03.800 --> 01:27:04.961
What's Troy mad about?

1621
01:27:05.119 --> 01:27:06.405
I don't know.

1622
01:27:07.079 --> 01:27:08.444
I know. Totally.

1623
01:27:09.439 --> 01:27:10.645
We're a total fraud!

1624
01:27:10.760 --> 01:27:12.000
Do you think
they can see through us?

1625
01:27:12.159 --> 01:27:14.048
Of course not!
We're wearing eye shadow!

1626
01:27:14.159 --> 01:27:15.889
Being cool is so exhausting.

1627
01:27:16.680 --> 01:27:22.083
Who's the birthday girl?
Huh? Hey! Hello?

1628
01:27:23.479 --> 01:27:27.121
Six years of drama school for this?

1629
01:27:27.399 --> 01:27:28.525
Move it, will you?

1630
01:27:31.680 --> 01:27:33.329
What are you doing? Come on!

1631
01:27:33.439 --> 01:27:35.203
You know what?
This is okay. This is fine.

1632
01:27:35.319 --> 01:27:37.402
We just need to go
to our happy place.

1633
01:27:37.520 --> 01:27:38.567
<i>? TripleDent gum ?</i>

1634
01:27:38.680 --> 01:27:40.408
No! Not this again!

1635
01:28:13.921 --> 01:28:25.925
<b><i>sub by: ChesterJohn</i></b>
